<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan zinc imports rise 11.5 pct yr/yr -- MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan zinc imports rise 11.5 pct yr/yr -- MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined zinc imports in January rose 11.5 percent to 9,089 tonnes from 8,152 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Ministry of Finance data released on Friday showed.</p>
<p>Figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			 Jan 97    Dec 96	Jan 96</p>
<p> Total		 9,089     4,637	 8,152</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> China		 6,378     2,050	 3,800</p>
<p>Refined zinc imports 1996 were 134,798 tonnes, up 15.2 percent from 116,986 tonnes the year before.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
